        "look"
      ],
      "unsupportedVerbText": "That approach will not help here. Look for a description, or choose one of the listed actions; every useful action also has a labeled control.",
      "evidenceIds": [],
      "actionIds": []
    },
    {
      "id": "spec001:HOTSPOT-golem",
      "subjectId": "spec001:CH12",
      "label": "Iron Golem",
      "description": "The Iron Golem holds a stack of maintenance cards. “I am a support structure,” its placard says, “not a substitute for a test.” Team recruitment is a later workshop activity; no ally gates this introduction.",
      "verbs": [
        "look"
      ],
      "unsupportedVerbText": "The Golem has no introductory dialogue transaction yet. Look at its maintenance placard, then use the conventional tools and table; no recruitment is required.",
      "evidenceIds": [],
      "actionIds": []
    },
    {
      "id": "spec001:HOTSPOT-workbench",
      "subjectId": "spec001:PR011",
      "label": "Workshop length exercise",
      "description": "A leather bellows breathes beside the workbench furnace. The workbench mirrors the lift training path: compare the fictional 100 m inclusive limit with the initial 95 m + 10 m path or the direct 85 m + 10 m path. Return to the Arrival Lift to change and inspect the actual selector. A length pass proves length only; it does not finish the copper branch.",
      "verbs": [
